wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-appraisal-name = cargo appraisal tool
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-appraisal-desc = Checks an item's market value and helps verify a completed bounty inside a crate. Numbers beat a label saying "probably everything".
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-contraband-name = special cargo appraisal tool
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-contraband-desc = Shows a contraband item's listed turn-in value, when one exists. Use the ordinary appraiser for its market price.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-labeler-name = hand labeler
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-labeler-desc = Labels items and warehouse containers. "Miscellaneous" is a request for the next shift to waste another hour.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-box-name = empty cardboard box
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-box-desc = A box for sorting and packing small items. An engine will not fit, even if you fold its manifest in half.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-cardboard-name = packing cardboard — 10 sheets
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-cardboard-desc = Ten sheets of cardboard for making boxes. Ready-made boxes are sold separately; ask Bors for bulk material shipments.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-clipboard-name = shipping clipboard
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-clipboard-desc = Keeps documents together with a slot for a pen. The simplest way to keep an order from disappearing between dispatch and the warehouse.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-paper-name = blank manifest sheet
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-paper-desc = One blank sheet: record the sender, contents and recipient. Paper puts up with anything; the storekeeper prefers legible handwriting.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-pen-name = storekeeper's pen
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-pen-desc = An ordinary pen for signatures, lists and manifests. You still have to correct the paperwork yourself.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-approved-name = APPROVED stamp
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-approved-desc = A green mark for checked documents. Count the cargo first, then give the paper its good news.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-denied-name = DENIED stamp
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-denied-desc = A red mark for faulty documents. Sometimes one stamp is clearer than a half-hour argument.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-crowbar-name = work crowbar
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-crowbar-desc = For panels and unpowered airlocks. Best not to use it to flatten your manifests.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-wrench-name = warehouse wrench
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-wrench-desc = For fittings and equipment assembly. Useful when someone decides that shelf ought to be somewhere else again.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-light-name = work flashlight
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-light-desc = A flashlight with an installed battery for dark aisles and tiny labels. A missing crate is under no obligation to glow.
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-duffel-name = cargo duffel bag
wh40k-footfall-cargo-shop-duffel-desc = A spacious bag for tools and small cargo. Contents not included: warehouse order starts with an empty container.
